    'Body: `{action, newContentHash, metadata?, title?}`. `action` is one ' +
    "of `watermark` | `sign-cert`. `newContentHash` is a sha256 hex digest " +
    '(64 lowercase hex chars, optional `sha256:` prefix). `metadata` is ' +
    "free-form issuer metadata folded into the new doc's data blob.\n\n" +
